  "body": "If you're looking for a home that offers generous living space, a peaceful setting, multiple bathrooms and excellent school zoning, then look no further - 50 Redwing Street could be exactly what you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nDesigned with comfortable family living in mind, this home provides the space and flexibility growing families need, while enjoying a quiet and welcoming environment. With multiple bathroom facilities to make busy mornings easier and sought-after school zones adding long-term appeal, this is a home that brings together space, comfort, convenience and location.\r\n\r\n- CCC and New Title both issued. Making your move-in planning straightforward and convenient.\r\n- The lower level features a single internal-access garage, a study, plus a separate bathroom, offering excellent flexibility for working from home, guests or extended family.\r\n- The main living level boasts a spacious open-plan living and dining area, complemented by a convenient guest toilet.\r\n- The upper floor includes a master suite, an additional well-sized bedroom, and a separate bathroom, providing privacy and comfort for family living.\r\n- With its practical layout, multiple bathroom facilities and flexible living spaces, this is a home designed to suit modern family life.\r\n\r\nCall/Text now for more information, private view always welcomed, otherwise look forward to seeing you at the open home.",
